Claim the card; that already moves it to working, so this is one request.
Fails with exit 4 if another actor holds the lease. --branch records the git
branch the work is on, shown by 'show' and the dashboard. --for states how
long the claim lasts without a renewal, as on 'claim'.

Examples:
  lorvik start 42
  lorvik start 42 --branch card-42-lanes
  lorvik start 42 --for 1h

Usage
  lorvik start <number> [flags]

Flags
      --branch string   Git branch the work is on
      --for string      How long the claim lasts without a renewal, such as 1h (1m to 24h); default the project's lease
  -h, --help            help for start

Global flags
      --api-url string   Server URL (default: LORVIK_API_URL)
      --json             Output the raw API JSON
  -p, --project string   Project slug (default: LORVIK_PROJECT or .lorvik.toml)
  -Q, --quiet            Suppress the unread notice on stderr and an empty inbox
      --session string   Session label for this chat (default: LORVIK_SESSION or derived; see lorvik session)
